OL,3,AMore young hikers lost using Google
OL,4,AMaps, say rescuers
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore young people are getting caught
OL,7,Fout on the fells due to relying on
OL,8,FGoogle Maps for navigation, rescuers
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FAfter a full-team rescue on Sunday,
OL,12,FWasdale Mountain Rescue Team (WMRT)
OL,13,Fsaid an increasing amount of young
OL,14,Fpeople, mostly aged 18 to 24, were
OL,15,Fgetting lost or into trouble after
OL,16,Fusing Google Maps on their phones.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
