OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMore young hikers lost using Google
OL,4,AMaps, say rescuers
OL,5,
OL,6,FWMRT said Google Maps was "not made for
OL,7,Fthe mountains", because unlike a paper
OL,8,Fmap, the app does not display steep
OL,9,Frocky outcrops, fell paths and
OL,10,Fcontours, which show three-dimensional
OL,11,Fshape of the land.
OL,13,FThe advice to use a paper map - which
OL,14,Fis echoed by Google - has been repeated
OL,15,Fby rescue teams for years, so how can
OL,16,Fnavigation be made more available to
OL,17,Fyoung people?
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
